With the Russian Bouquet app, choosing flowers and gifts has become even easier! Find gifts for yourself and your loved ones then order  delivery through our application.

In our application you will find:

- Wonderful bouquets of a variety of flowers (roses, tulips, chrysanthemums, sunflowers);
- Incredible flower arrangements in baskets and boxes;
- All kinds of gifts (soft toys, balloons, sweets);
- Baskets of sweets, vegetables, fruits and other delicious treats;
- Thematic gifts and sets for the holidays;
- Potted plants from the most unpretentious to real exotic;
- Cosmetic and care sets for him and for her;
- Postcards and lots of nice little things to decorate your gifts.

We have divided our huge assortment into categories so that you can find the desired gift even faster. Use the convenient filters to find the desired bouquet or gift.

In the application, we place the products of our partners, and the range is constantly updated. We try to please you with new arrivals as often as possible!

Ease of use:
It is very easy to make an order for flowers in Russia and the world with us! Choose the bouquet or gift you like and place an order.

Secure payment
It is easy to buy flowers and plants from us thanks to convenient payment methods. You can choose among the currencies to find a convenient one and pay for the delivery of bouquets through secure systems without commission.

Bonus system:
For each order of flowers, bonus points are awarded to the account. Points can be used to pay up to 50% of the cost of the following orders. On holidays we prepare personal discounts and nice gifts for everyone. You can see your bonuses in the profile.

The purpose of the Russian Bouquet app is to help you express your emotions through flowers. We try to make your friends and loved ones happy with our wonderful flowers and gifts!
